    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74409" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξῠ-ωπής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
